WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
After you complete your onboarding
and training videos,

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:07.040
you can now search and accept
available jobs for your role

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:11.560
and any roles under you by clicking
on the Job Board icon.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:18.440
You can filter by location, radius, community,
start date, lot number, or workers,

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.200
then simply click Apply.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.640
Select any job shown to see
the actual location on the map.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:30.480
You will see estimated start and completion
dates shown for each job.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:36.360
To accept a job, click on the checkbox next
to the lot number and click Register.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:40.560
You will then be asked to confirm that
you want to register for that job.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:47.000
After clicking Confirm, any accepted jobs
will now appear under the My Jobs icon.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.080
You can accept jobs up to two weeks out
and view later dates.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:57.920
But don't worry, the system will prevent you
from accepting jobs that will create overlapping to ensure quality work.
